  "comments": "Mentioned by 'Gos lo tsA ba (ID:5839) and listed in A khu ching Shes rab rgya mtsho's Tho yig ([5RXEUKD9]: 523, No. 11333: zhang tshe spong pa chos kyi bla ma [...] mdzad pa'i rgyud bla ma'i Tik+ka). \r\nSee [ENNZCF55]: 66 and Kano [BAQ9MH4T]: 408.\r\n\r\nAccording to 'Gos lo tsA ba, this commentary was based on rNgog Blo ldan shes rab's small commentary (ID:4441). See [7V8MZYAI]: 4 (rngog gis rgyud bla ma'i 'grel pa la TI kA chung yang mdzad cing | de la brten nas gro lung pa dang | zhang tshes kyis kyang TI kA mdzad de |).",
